Title:  You can have a studio and you can take your time

Seq:    5.7.1.1.5

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Beatles, The|The Beatles]], 2000, from the book *[[The Beatles Anthology]]*


Body:

It’s as if we were painters who had never *really* been allowed to paint — we’d just had to go selling our paintings up and down the country. Then, suddenly, we had someone telling us, “You can have a studio and you can paint and you can take your time.”
